※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4412 LANG_MATCH_UNKNOWN_ALTERNATIVE

※ An arm names the type of the alternative it takes, and this one names a type
※ the value has no alternative of, so the arm could never be the one that runs.

let hundred: mut u8 = 100u8
let seven: mut u8 = 7u8

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    match hundred ÷ seven:
        u16(q):
            return 0u8
        ⊥:
            return 1u8
